  - concepts
  - type classes
  - System F
  - parametricity
  - structural recursion
  - compile-time programming
  - category theory
  - lattices
  - intensional sets
  - symbolic algebra
  - set theory
  - relational calculus
  - many-valued logic
  - compile-time optimisation
